{
    "title": "Poster Maker - Flyer Creator",
    "description": "Poster Maker is a powerful real-time flyer creator Android tool \u2714\ufe0f\r\n\r\n<h1>Everyone is <b>CREATIVE</b> with Poster Maker - Flyer Creator</h1>\ud83d\udc40\r\n\r\nPoster Maker is an ideal sign creator app to turn photos or pics into inspirational images, greetings, or love cards, which are so easy to share right from the sign creator app! Poster Maker - flyer creator has numerous design templates, thousands of creative stickers, flyer designs, artwork graphics, text art, and various shapes. So you can design everything instantly and effortlessly. \ud83d\ude0e\r\n\r\n<b>Use Poster Maker - Flyer Creator for Everything:</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49Poster Maker, Flyer Maker, Banner Maker, Page Designer, Sign Creator;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Logo design, Book cover, Blog design, Album covers, Scrapbooking, and Template Maker;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Highlight Cover Maker and Flyer Creator;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Make highlights icons;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Wedding Invitation Card Maker and RSVP Creator;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Spa and Salon Flyers & Posters;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Make HD Wallpaper for your Mobile. Photo, Image, and Banner Maker;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Flyer Maker and Flyer design;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Add Text on Photos or Images - make a flyer;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Create a daily instaquote.;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Insta Story Maker and Story Editor;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Write a Story, Your Quote, Poems, Stories & Shayari;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Make Business Logos and Business Cards;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Greetings Card Maker, Christmas Wishes Cards Maker, Birthday card maker, Evite creator;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Fast, Simple, and free image editing flyer maker;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Flyer maker and banner maker for festivals, events, and occasions;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Social Media Marketing Banner and Flyer Design.\r\n\ud83d\udc49Make cards and invites and even use Poster Maker as a flyer maker, banner maker, or logo creator;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Stunning Story Templates\r\n\ud83d\udc49Design Inspirational Daily Quotes, Motivational quotes, Love quotes, and love cards for valentines Day and humorous memes;\r\n\ud83d\udc49Party invitation maker, school poster maker, video banner maker\r\n\ud83d\udc49For business: logo, graphic design, brochure, CV, resume, sign creator, presentation, promo flyer maker.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><h2>Key Features of Poster Maker - flyer creator:</h2></b>\r\n\r\n<b>Customizable Templates</b> Professionally and ready-to-use, fully editable and eye-catching templates.\r\n\r\n<b>Photo Effect</b> Give a special touch to your photos with Beautiful Photo Filters, Photo Overlays, and the best photo editing tools like Brightness, Contrast, Hue, Exposure, Blur, and Saturation.\r\n\r\n<b>Shapes</b> Customize 25+ shapes with height, width, color, border size, and border width.\r\n\r\n<b>Text Editing</b> Easy and fast text editing tools like stroke, alignment, curve, spacing, shadow, and erase.\r\n\r\n<b>Sign creator: Text Editor & add text to photos</b> Easily add quotes or multiple text to photos. Change the font, size, color, spacing, and position using this simple, easy-to-use Sign Creator.\r\n\r\n<b>Stylish Fonts</b> 200+ typography, signature, title, headline, script, and stylish fonts with regular updates.\r\n\r\n<b>5000+ Graphics</b> Beautifully designed hand-crafted artwork and cute stickers with regular updates.\r\n\r\n<b>Add Logo or Watermark</b> With this fantastic flyer creator, You can add your logo, images, or any watermark to your photo.\r\n\r\n<b>Create Stickers</b> You can create stickers with different shapes.\r\n\r\n<b>Unsplash</b> No Photo? No Problem! We've partnered with one of the best photo sources to put fresh daily images in your hand. Just look for Unsplash.\r\nShare your designs on social media or email, or save them on your device.\r\n\r\nMake a flyer fast and easy with Flyer Creator!\r\n\r\n<i>Disclaimer\r\nAll product names, logos, brands, trademarks, and registered trademarks, which we do not own, are the property of their respective owners. \r\nAll company, product and service names used in this app are for identification purposes only. Use of these names, trademarks, and brands does not imply endorsement.\r\nWe own the Poster Maker - Flyer Creator app. We are not affiliated, associated, authorized, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with any 3rd party apps or companies.</i>",
    "descriptionHTML": "Poster Maker is a powerful real-time flyer creator Android tool \u2714\ufe0f<br><br><h1>Everyone is <b>CREATIVE</b> with Poster Maker - Flyer Creator</h1>\ud83d\udc40<br><br>Poster Maker is an ideal sign creator app to turn photos or pics into inspirational images, greetings, or love cards, which are so easy to share right from the sign creator app! Poster Maker - flyer creator has numerous design templates, thousands of creative stickers, flyer designs, artwork graphics, text art, and various shapes. So you can design everything instantly and effortlessly. \ud83d\ude0e<br><br><b>Use Poster Maker - Flyer Creator for Everything:</b><br><br>\ud83d\udc49Poster Maker, Flyer Maker, Banner Maker, Page Designer, Sign Creator;<br>\ud83d\udc49Logo design, Book cover, Blog design, Album covers, Scrapbooking, and Template Maker;<br>\ud83d\udc49Highlight Cover Maker and Flyer Creator;<br>\ud83d\udc49Make highlights icons;<br>\ud83d\udc49Wedding Invitation Card Maker and RSVP Creator;<br>\ud83d\udc49Spa and Salon Flyers &amp; Posters;<br>\ud83d\udc49Make HD Wallpaper for your Mobile. Photo, Image, and Banner Maker;<br>\ud83d\udc49Flyer Maker and Flyer design;<br>\ud83d\udc49Add Text on Photos or Images - make a flyer;<br>\ud83d\udc49Create a daily instaquote.;<br>\ud83d\udc49Insta Story Maker and Story Editor;<br>\ud83d\udc49Write a Story, Your Quote, Poems, Stories &amp; Shayari;<br>\ud83d\udc49Make Business Logos and Business Cards;<br>\ud83d\udc49Greetings Card Maker, Christmas Wishes Cards Maker, Birthday card maker, Evite creator;<br>\ud83d\udc49Fast, Simple, and free image editing flyer maker;<br>\ud83d\udc49Flyer maker and banner maker for festivals, events, and occasions;<br>\ud83d\udc49Social Media Marketing Banner and Flyer Design.<br>\ud83d\udc49Make cards and invites and even use Poster Maker as a flyer maker, banner maker, or logo creator;<br>\ud83d\udc49Stunning Story Templates<br>\ud83d\udc49Design Inspirational Daily Quotes, Motivational q