 company, product and service names used in this app are for identification purposes only. Use of these names, trademarks, and brands does not imply endorsement.<br>We own the Poster Maker - Flyer Creator app. We are not affiliated, associated, authorized, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with any 3rd party apps or companies.</i>",
